{"type":"message","message":{"id":"gen-1775333501-T8LS3KjFGFCunxP5iXED","role":"assistant","created":1775333509,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Aha! So I need to add 0.5 for amounts with footnote 1/ (which represents 1/2). Let me recalculate:\n\nFor 1963, I need to add:\n- 2,954.5 instead of 2,954 (added 0.5)\n- 2,380.5 instead of 2,380 (added 0.5)\n- 4,286.5 instead of 4,286 (added 0.5)\n\nSo the adjustment is: 0.5 + 0.5 + 0.5 = 1.5\n\nNew total for 1963: 53,369 + 1.5 = 53,370.5\n\nLet me verify my calculation and update:\n- 1962: $64,537 million\n- 1963: $53,370.5 million (adjusted)\n- 1964: $64,480 million\n\nTotal: 64,537 + 53,370.5 + 64,480 = 182,387.5\n\nShare of March 1964: 64,480 / 182,387.5 = 0.353536...\n\nRounded to 4 decimal places: 0.3535\n\nActually wait - let me make sure about the 1964 data too.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_520b6c04197849eca37bde4d","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\n# Check 1964 for footnote amounts too\nwith open('/app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1964_04_page_82.txt', 'r') as f:\n    content = f.read()\n\n# Find Table 3 section\nstart_marker = \"Table 3.- Treasury Notes\"\nend_marker = \"</table>\"\n\nstart_idx = content.find(start_marker)\nafter_start = content[start_idx:]\ntable_end = after_start.find(end_marker)\n\ntable_section = after_start[:table_end]\n\nimport re\n\nlines = table_section.split('</tr>')\nprint(\"Checking for footnote amounts in 1964:\")\nfor line in lines:\n    if '<td>' in line:\n        match = re.search(r'<td>([\\d,]+)\\s*(\\d+/)?', line)\n        if match:\n            amount = match.group(1)\n            footnote = match.group(2)\n            if footnote:\n                print(f\"  Amount with footnote: {amount} {footnote}\")\n                val = float(amount.replace(',', '')) + 0.5\n                print(f\"    -> {val}\")\nEOF"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
